@CC ===================================================================
@CC (SYSTEM)HENT-MODE:MODE   --- GENERIC TEMPLATE ---
@CC Replace every <TOKEN> before use. See mode-files/README.md for the
@CC full substitution table.
@CC
@CC COLD-START mode file. Run BY HAND after a cold start:
@CC     @ENTER-DIRECTORY <MAIN-DIR> <DISC-DEVICE> 0
@CC     (log in as SYSTEM)
@CC     @MODE (SYSTEM)HENT-MODE:MODE,,,
@CC On a cold start the initial commands are NOT executed automatically;
@CC this file re-defines them (they persist in the image for warm starts).
@CC ===================================================================
@SET-UNAVAILABLE $THE COMPUTER IS BEING COLD-STARTED$
@CC
@CC --- Define the initial commands (stored in the SINTRAN image) --------
@INITIAL-COMMAND ENTER-DIRECTORY <MAIN-DIR> <DISC-DEVICE> 0
@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND CONNECT-FILE SYSTEM-OUTPUT-1 105 W
@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND CLOSE-FILE 105
@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND SET-ERROR-DEVICE 1
@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND BATCH 1
@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND APPEND-BATCH 1 LOAD-MODE:BATC SYSTEM-OUTPUT-1
@CC
@CC --- Enter any EXTRA directories (one pair per additional pack) ------
@CC @ENTER-DIRECTORY <OTHER-DIR> <DISC-DEVICE> <UNIT>
@CC @SET-DEFAULT-DIRECTORY <OTHER-DIR>
@CC
@CC --- Define the segment file, background programs, RT ----------------
@SINTRAN-SERVICE-PROGRAM
@DEFINE-SEGMENT-FILE Y Y 0 <SEGMENT-FILE>
@EXIT
@INITIALIZE-BACKGROUND-PROGRAMS
@RTENTER
@CC
@CC --- Load the DMA/comms driver into its segment ---------------------
@RT-LOADER
READ-BINARY (BPUN-FILES)<DMAC-BINARY> <DMAC-SEG>
YES
END-LOAD
EXIT
@CC
@CC --- Load the COSMOS TAD administrator into segment 36 (S3TAD) -------
@CC     Needed BEFORE @START-TADADM, else you get "TADADM NOT LOADED".
@CC     COS-TADADM:BPUN comes from SINTRAN generated WITH TAD support
@CC     (copied to (SYSTEM)), NOT from the COSMOS Basic floppy.
@CC     Omit this block if this machine has no TADs / no remote terminal
@CC     access. Confirm the file exists: @LIST-FILES (SYSTEM)COS-TADADM
@RT-LOADER
READ-BINARY (SYSTEM)COS-TADADM 36
YES
END-LOAD
EXIT
@CC
@CC --- Initialise MAIL -------------------------------------------------
@MAIL
@INITIALIZE 10
@RUN-MAIL
@EXIT
@CC
@CC --- Make editors/compilers reentrant (cold start only) -------------
@MODE (UTILITY)DUMP-REENTRANT:MODE,,,
@CC
@CC --- Load XMSG reentrant (COSMOS needs the inter-system version) -----
@MODE (UTILITY)XMSG-LOAD:MODE,,,
@CC
@CC --- COSMOS BASIC cold-start half (OPTIONAL; delete if no COSMOS) ----
@CC     COSMOS-specific; see COSMOS Basic / COS-BOOT-WIRING.md
@MODE (<COSMOS-USER>)COS-HENT-<REV>:MODE,,
@CC
@CC --- Hand off to the warm-start job ---------------------------------
@CONNECT-FILE SYSTEM-OUTPUT-1 105 W
@CLOSE-FILE 105
@SET-ERROR-DEVICE 1
@BATCH 1
@APPEND-BATCH 1 LOAD-MODE:BATC SYSTEM-OUTPUT-1
@CC ===================================================================
@CC END OF HENT-MODE:MODE
@CC ===================================================================
